# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RakPlus UAE — Environment Variables
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in real values.
# `.env.example` itself IS committed so the required keys stay documented.
#
# ⚠ NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are INLINED INTO THE CLIENT BUNDLE at build time.
#   Never place a server secret behind a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix — only put
#   values here that are safe to read publicly in the shipped JavaScript.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ─── Contact / RFQ form lead delivery (OPTIONAL) ─────────────────
#
# Where POSTs from the B2B inquiry form on /contact/ are delivered.
#
# SET THIS:  the form POSTs the full JSON RFQ payload to your endpoint.
#            Works with Formspree, Zapier Catch Hook, Make, Webflow
#            Forms, or any HTTPS endpoint that accepts JSON.
# LEAVE BLANK: the form automatically falls back to FormSubmit AJAX
#            (https://formsubmit.co/ajax/info@rakplusuae.com), which
#            forwards the lead server-side to the RakPlus inbox with no
#            third-party account required. B2B inquiries are never lost.
#
# The visitor ALWAYS additionally gets a 1-click "Send via Email /
# WhatsApp" confirmation hand-off, so the lead is recoverable even if
# every network path fails.
#
# Example:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=